# Preset: stm32f042_klipper_expander
#
# Voron Klipper Expander (STM32F042F6P6, internal 48 MHz clock, USB on
# PA9/PA10 through the chip's pin remap). Settings match the board's own
# setup guide (VoronDesign/Voron-Hardware, Klipper_Expander), except for the
# bootloader: Katapult is flashed first at the start of flash, so Klipper
# starts 8KiB in (STM32_FLASH_START_2000). Katapult is 4.5KiB, which does not
# fit a 4KiB offset. Wrong offset erases Katapult, see
# biokalico_extras/firmware_flash.md.
#
# The chip has only 32 KiB of flash, 24 KiB of it left for Klipper after
# Katapult. With every optional feature on, the image is about 40 KiB, so the
# features this board cannot use are switched off. Kept: ADC (the two
# thermistor ports), hardware PWM (the four MOSFET outputs) and neopixel.
#
# Minimized with scripts/firmware/minimize_config.py.

CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32F042=y
CONFIG_STM32_FLASH_START_2000=y
CONFIG_STM32_CLOCK_REF_INTERNAL=y
CONFIG_STM32_USB_PA11_PA12_REMAP=y
# CONFIG_WANT_SOFTWARE_SPI is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_SOFTWARE_I2C is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_TMCUART is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_PULSE_COUNTER is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_ST7920 is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_HD44780 is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_ADXL345 is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_LIS2DW is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_THERMOCOUPLE is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_HX71X is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_ADS1220 is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_ADS131MX is not set
# CONFIG_WANT_GPIO_I2C is not set
